#. module: eh_hr_core
#: model:res.groups,comment:eh_hr_core.group_hr_kiosk_device
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Granted to dedicated kiosk service users only.  Members cannot\n"
"                see the Odoo UI; they may only POST attendance events via the\n"
"                kiosk REST endpoint.  Never grant to humans.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Alleen verleend aan speciale kiosk-serviceaccounts.  Leden kunnen\n"
"                de Odoo-interface niet zien; zij mogen alleen aanwezigheidsgebeurtenissen POST'en via het\n"
"                kiosk-REST-eindpunt.  Ken dit nooit toe aan mensen."

